VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT aftershock.delivery-observed
GOAL
  Observe a genuine recent research cycle, not only an agent heartbeat.
CLAIM delivered-cycle REQUIRED
  ENSURE a completed research cycle is recent and has a readable critique verdict, distinct from a heartbeat
VERIFY delivered-cycle
  USING aftershock.observer
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
